  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For some people who are mute, in the sense that their microphone works just fine but they don’t want to turn it on, people will now use the new Chatbox feature. That way they won’t have to talk. But typing in VR is S L O W. So, what if you could have speech to text on the keyboard? Your in game mic would stay muted but the keyboard STT would hear it and type out the words for you. Its a much more efficient way of getting out what you want to say on a keyboard in VR Instead of waiting a year to type a sentence. Please consider because this would help out a lot!",
